"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D440\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D440\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the molar mass of 'X'.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Substituting in the given values:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.158ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"46.078ex\" height=\"3.628ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1091.9 20366.6 1603.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(633,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D44B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44B\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1563.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2619,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(581.3,481.4) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"38\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-38\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> mg</text></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,-370.3) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"39\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-39\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Robot